      "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tSynthetic QA Taste-S Codec Chat\n\t\n\n18571 single-turn Traditional Chinese QA utterances with synthesized speech, 21.6 hours of\naudio before codec extraction.\nAssistant speech is represented as:\n<SAY> text_token <a_code> <b_code> ... <p_code> ... </SAY>\n\nEach text token is followed by its 16 Taste-S FSQ codes (codebooks a..p).\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tConfigurations\n\t\n\ndefault — messages (user question + assistant <SAY> speech), audio, and answer text.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tStatistics\n\t\n\n\nUtterances: 18571… See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/yilele/synth-qa-taste-codec-chat.",
